      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im kinda worried. about an hour ago my vision went super blurry in my left eye for like two minutes and my right hand felt really clumsy and awkward when i tried to pick something up. but its totally gone now so im fine. do i need to go to the hospital or just keep an eye on it?",
