    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "telehealth still takes forever to get an appointment. look i'm telling you, the symptoms are totally gone and i have no headache or anything else going on. i'm pretty sure it was just a weird fluke or eye strain. honestly i think it's a waste of time and money to go in when i feel fine. if i just stay home tonight and rest, and it doesn't happen again, can i just assume it was nothing? i'd rather just monitor it myself for a few days.",
